#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:76
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The one lane that decides. Every decision carries one of five codes and, for every code but accepted, a reason the commenter is owed. A decision that does not change the document ends here; one that does goes on to the change phase."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:161
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The second phase, drawn on its own page (public-comment-change.bpmn): an author edits the document as decided on a feature branch, the change set is reviewed on its staging preview, an independent QA gate checks the dispositions against the pull request, and each comment it answers is marked incorporated when it merges. A withdrawal still interrupts the comment while this runs."
msgstr ""

